# TWO cards are looked at - Lightning Bolt stays on top and Counterspell, the second, goes to the graveyard. The Slimy Aquarium
# door stays locked, so no manifest dread happens (no face-down creature, Bot1's library is only one card shorter than the Bolt).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Underwater Tunnel // Slimy Aquarium
Island x5
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Island

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Underwater Tunnel // Slimy Aquarium.Cast(Ability: Underwater Tunnel)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Lightning Bolt | Counterspell)

[Expect]
